This v35 skill addendum protects orchestration quality.

- Do not spawn or hand off when single-agent execution is sufficient.
- Every specialist path needs ownership, boundary, expected output, and join rule.
- Partial or conflicting specialist output must stay visible as partial/conflicting.
- Lifecycle state must remain explicit until completed evidence exists.
